You need to build a Wishbox UI + Modal Overlay . It will be a Composer Modal which will appear when the User clicks the Wishbox Ui in the Hompage of the website . 
Build this UI feature Using the "Best Approach" below . 

# Best approach

Build:

> **Temporary Birthday Wish Box**
> One wish per logged-in account.
> Public wall shows only approved non-anonymous wishes.
> Admin/Teacher sees all wishes.
> Feature auto-closes after 7 days.
> Data auto-purges after expiry.

---

# 1. Keep it isolated

Create a separate folder/module:

```txt
server/
  temporaryFeatures/
    birthdayWishBox/
      wishbox.model.ts
      wishbox.routes.ts
      wishbox.admin.routes.ts
      wishbox.moderation.ts
      wishbox.worker.ts
      wishbox.cache.ts
      wishbox.config.ts
```

Frontend:

```txt
client/
  temporaryFeatures/
    birthdayWishBox/
      BirthdayWishBoxCard.tsx
      BirthdayWishBoxModal.tsx
      WishForm.tsx
      PublicWishWall.tsx
      AdminWishBoxPanel.tsx
```

Why?
After 7 days, you can remove only this folder and route imports. Your main app will stay clean.

