# 9. Redis caching

Cache only public data.

## Public wishes cache

Key:

```txt
wishbox:teacher_birthday_2026:public:page:1:limit:20
```

TTL:

```txt
60 seconds
```

## Stats cache

Key:

```txt
wishbox:teacher_birthday_2026:stats
```

TTL:

```txt
60 seconds
```

When moderation approves/rejects wishes:

```ts
await redis.del("wishbox:teacher_birthday_2026:stats");
await deletePattern("wishbox:teacher_birthday_2026:public:*");
```

This prevents too many DB hits.

