# 10. Rate limiting

Even though only one wish per account is allowed, still add rate limits.

For submit endpoint:

```txt
Per user: 1 successful wish per event
Per IP: 10 attempts per hour
Per account: 5 failed attempts per hour
```

Why?
Some students may keep trying abusive messages until one passes.

Use express-rate-limit or your existing Redis limiter.

