# 13. Auto-close after 7 days

After end date:

User side should show:

```txt
Birthday Wish Box is now closed.
Thank you for sending your love and wishes.
```

Disable:

```txt
POST /api/wishbox/wishes
```

But still allow admin to view/export until purge date if needed.

Recommended:

```txt
Feature active: 7 days
Admin export window: 2 extra days
Data purge: after 10 days
```

But if HR strictly says purge after 7 days, set:

```ts
purgeAt = endDate;
```

Better practical version:

```ts
purgeAt = new Date("2026-05-10T23:59:59+05:30");
```

This gives the team time to export wishes.

