# 14. Purging data

Use MongoDB TTL index:

```ts
BirthdayWishSchema.index({ purgeAt: 1 }, { expireAfterSeconds: 0 });
```

Every wish has:

```ts
purgeAt: new Date("2026-05-10T23:59:59+05:30")
```

MongoDB will automatically delete it after that time.

This is perfect for temporary features.

