# Final recommendation

Build a **simple isolated temporary module**:

> **One account = one wish. Wishes are saved instantly as pending, locally filtered first, batch-moderated by AI every 30 seconds, cached for public viewing, visible publicly only if approved and non-anonymous, visible fully to admin, and automatically disabled/purged after 7 days.**

That is the cleanest “just works” version.
